<p>After killing a foe, you have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5">20%, 40%, 60%, 80%, 100%</acronym> chance to gain a 1000% movement speed bonus for 1 game turn.</p><p>The bonus disappears as soon as any action other than moving is done.</p><p>Note: since you will be moving very fast, game turns will pass very slowly.</p>